навливайте их маркированной стороной вверх.\n"]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"item","attrs":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"ptxt","attrs":{},"children":["\nПервое кольцо и второе кольцо отличаются формой участка контакта с поверхностью стенки цилиндра. Идентификация осуществляется по схеме.\n"]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"item","attrs":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"ptxt","attrs":{},"children":["\nПри установке смазочного кольца (4) установите проставку, а затем установите две направляющие.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"figure","attrs":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"graphic","attrs":{"graphicname":"I8T401142098.swf","width":"88.000mm","height":"70.913mm","path":"images/I8T401142098.webp","pixelWidth":503,"pixelHeight":656},"children":[]},"\n"]},"\n"]},"\n"]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"s1","attrs":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"ptxt","attrs":{},"children":["\nПосле установки трех колец совместите отверстия каждого кольца, как показано на рисунке.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"figure","attrs":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"graphic","attrs":{"graphicname":"IFAE0A140127.swf","width":"88.000mm","height":"34.321mm","path":"images/IFAE0A140127.webp","pixelWidth":607,"pixelHeight":562},"children":[]},"\n",{"tag":"callout","attrs":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"table","attrs":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"tgroup","attrs":{"cols":"2"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"colspec","attrs":{"colnum":"1","colname":"1","colwidth":"0.315in"},"children":[]},"\n",{"tag":"colspec","attrs":{"colnum":"2","colname":"2","colwidth":"2.362in"},"children":[]},"\n",{"tag":"tbody","attrs":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"row","attrs":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"entry","attrs":{"colname":"1","valign":"top","align":"right"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"ptxt","attrs":{},"children":["\n“a”:\n"]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"entry","attrs":{"colname":"2","valign":"top","align":"left"},"children":["\n",{"tag":"ptxt","attrs":{},"children":["\n45°\n"]},"\n"]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"row","attrs":{},"children":["\n",{"tag":"entry","attrs":{"colname":"1","valign":"top","align":"right"},"children":["\n"